                            Rexx/SQL
                          for SQLite3


This directory contains the source code for Rexx/SQL for SQLite3.

To build this package, run the configure script in the top-level
directory, from the directory where you wish the object and
executable files to reside.

Valid targets for this port are:

rexxsql         - standalone binary of Rexx/SQL functions with "SQL" prefix
rexxlite        - standalone binary of Rexx/SQL functions with "LITE" prefix
librexxsql.so   - shared library of Rexx/SQL functions with "SQL" prefix
librexxlite.so  - shared library of Rexx/SQL functions with "LITE" prefix
